{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120310/extras/cfc28e29b487f4c94eae955b274d0bdf.avif?t=1713367768\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br>Sail around the entire world, from the snow capped mountains of North America to the Saharan plains of Africa, via everywhere in-between! Discover <strong>hundreds of real locations</strong>, set up <strong>vital trade routes</strong>, and <strong>search local markets for new goods to trade</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120310/extras/da7d79836434928241cdaa8f6a775bb1.poster.avif?t=1713367768\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120310/extras/da7d79836434928241cdaa8f6a775bb1.webm?t=1713367768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120310/extras/da7d79836434928241cdaa8f6a775bb1.mp4?t=1713367768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120310/extras/489051053621f532b0c510620ee8c7bf.avif?t=1713367768\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br>Arm yourself to the teeth with a plethora of <strong>swords, guns, cannons and armour</strong> as you fight against <strong>pirates, thieves, wild animals and mythical creatures.</strong> Can you become the master and commander of a unique <strong>&quot;rock-paper-scissors&quot; turn-based combat system</strong>?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120310/extras/021c9f46ef72c151382119bfbbe60cc1.poster.avif?t=1713367768\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120310/extras/021c9f46ef72c151382119bfbbe60cc1.webm?t=1713367768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120310/extras/021c9f46ef72c151382119bfbbe60cc1.mp4?t=1713367768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120310/extras/8b537f7984da8ce23fde7a57adec640f.avif?t=1713367768\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br>Load your vessel up to the deck with cannons and it will be <strong>formidable in combat</strong>, but you'll need to make sure you have the necessary cargo space for resources to <strong>support your crew</strong>. Keeping everything ship-shape can often be the difference between a successful voyage or being lost at sea!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120310/extras/4aba14b90b9c980625ce9ce737a99525.poster.avif?t=1713367768\" width=598 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120310/extras/4aba14b90b9c980625ce9ce737a99525.webm?t=1713367768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120310/extras/4aba14b90b9c980625ce9ce737a99525.mp4?t=1713367768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120310/extras/6b9542b5313d4c2f2371aacc7f1fd8be.avif?t=1713367768\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br>Become the <strong>world\u2019s greatest explorer</strong>! <strong>Take on contracts</strong> from various guilds to make discoveries, <strong>find treasures</strong> no one else can and <strong>rise through the ranks</strong>. Accrue enough fame and maybe you'll even brush up against royalty on your way to the top!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120310/extras/4602476b27fb2dddf12647971948b0c3.poster.avif?t=1713367768\" width=598 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120310/extras/4602476b27fb2dddf12647971948b0c3.webm?t=1713367768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120310/extras/4602476b27fb2dddf12647971948b0c3.mp4?t=1713367768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Graduated!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2120310/166266fbef4c9bb62e940348c07863c1f65c0e4d.jpg"},{"name":"Great Pyramid of Giza","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2120310/907c06d464f8c0131dafa29374cd67b2849adf41.jpg"},{"name":"Southern tip of africa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2120310/3b06af1eba0136334c0b88b97a024ca777f09f2f.jpg"},{"name":"Indian route","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2120310/e1a7bebcfaabf77e7bf44c61994fd2ff0c829fb6.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat the pirates","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2120310/c6c798862fedd543bc78d8abe3fdc7b7b602b8b9.jpg"},{"name":"Wreck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2120310/7e78069367d7cc8d797a43dc4aa95cedf03be087.jpg"},{"name":"Western continent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2120310/4d7fef6ad5ea14acd39cf3b1c725a8a3f06ac88b.jpg"},{"name":"Pirates of the caribbean","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2120310/cd30034f91a50d9f42bf6a894205a8acc5fc17ba.j